From 55aba82f6d1b08eb0ea3d36ec175caed8dfdf0ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:37:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ADD vim-style pane text selection so terminal users can
 copy focused content

Command-mode v starts a character selection in the focused pane, matching V and Ctrl-V line/block selection behavior. Yanking uses the existing visual selection extraction path, so right-pane chat text and left-pane rows copy through the same terminal clipboard mechanism.
